  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li#PL72.LI.1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.LI.1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Contra vosqui eredebant epistolas de cælo cecidisse in memoriam sabcti Petri Rimæ, (Nunc primum edita ex Ms. Ecclesiae Toletanæ.)",
    "chunk_index": 1,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li#PL72.LI.2.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.LI.2.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Inter varias tribulationum angustias non nos pi­ guit, cogente charitate Christi, hæc qualiacunque sunt, ad Sanctitatem veslram verba dirigere,",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li#PL72.LI.2.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.LI.2.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "insi­ nuantes accepisse nos liueras tuas, et de vestrae sospitatis bono gavisos.",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li#PL72.LI.2.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.LI.2.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sed in id non minime cun­ tristati sumus , quod litteras cujusdam, quas ad nos direxistis, sicut tuæ indicant litterae, susceperis, et de tribunali populis eas feceris annuntiari.",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li#PL72.LI.2.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.LI.2.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ego enim MOi a te transmissas accepi, in præsentia ipsius perlatoris exordium litterarum ipsarum legens;",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li#PL72.LI.2.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.LI.2.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "et non patienter ferens, nec dignum ducens nxnias ipsas perlegere, statim scidi, et eas in terram pro­ jeci,",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li#PL72.LI.2.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.LI.2.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "admirans quod his credulus fueris, et post pro­ phetarum vaticinia, et Christi Evangelia , apostolo­ rumque ejus Epistolas,",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li#PL72.LI.2.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.LI.2.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "nescio cujus bominis litteras sub nomine Christi factas, ejus esse credideris|; ubi nec sermo elegans, nec doctrina sana poterit re­ pcriri.",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li#PL72.LI.3.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.LI.3.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "In principio ipsius epistolae legimus ut dies Domi­ nieus colatur.",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li#PL72.LI.3.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.LI.3.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quis enim Christianus, non propter ipsum diein , sed propter resurrectionem Domini nostri Jesu Christi, eo quod in ipso a mortuis resur­ rexit, reverendissimum non habeat ?",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li#PL72.LI.3.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.LI.3.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sed, quantum sentio, ideo novus iste prædicator hoc dicit, ut nos judaizare compellat, ut nullus sibi in eodem die necessaria victus praeparet, aut viam ambulet.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li#PL72.LI.3.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.LI.3.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sed hoc quam pessimum sit, Sanctitas tua perpendat. Utinam populus Christianus si die ipso ecclesiam non frequentat, aliquod operis faceret, et non saltaret.",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li#PL72.LI.3.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.LI.3.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Meliusque erat viro hertum facere, iter agere, mu- lieri colum tenere, et non, ut dicitur, ballare ,",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li#PL72.LI.3.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.LI.3.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "sat­ tare, et membra a Deo bene condita saltanda male torquere, et ad excitandam libidinem nugatoribus cantionibus proclamare.",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li#PL72.LI.4.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.LI.4.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Absit ergo a Sanclitate tua hoc credere, ut epistole nunc nobis mittantur a Christo.",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li#PL72.LI.4.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.LI.4.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sufficiat enim quod locutus est in prophetis per se ipsum , et per suus apostolos. Nam et his non litteras transmittebat e coelo, sed Spiritu saucto eorum coria replebat.",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li#PL72.LI.4.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.LI.4.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ex­ ceptis enim decem praeceptis, quae hi tabulis lapideis mirabiliter data sunt, ad nullum prophetarum aut apostolorum Epistolæ missæ sunt de coelo.",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li#PL72.LI.4.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.LI.4.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Non igi­ tur credas quae nunquam facta leguntur : quae etsi facta essent, post praedicationem Evangelii jaru ne. cessaria non sunt.",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li#PL72.LI.4.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.LI.4.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et si forte ipsum nomen uovum te delectavit, quia ipsa epistola , sicut simulator scri­ psit, de ctelo descendit super altare Christi in me- moria sancti Petri apostoli ,",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li#PL72.LI.4.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.LI.4.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "scito diaboli esse figmen­ tum , et omnem scripturam divinam , epistolam, aat epistolas esse coelestes, et ad nos de coelo fuisse transmissas.",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li#PL72.LI.5.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.LI.5.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Einendet ergo quod temere credidit Sanctitas tua, et in praesentia populi ipsam epistolam, si est penes te, rescinde :",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li#PL72.LI.5.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.LI.5.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "et hoc te pœniteat quod de tribunali eam feceris recitari, beati apostoli sequens doctri­ nam, quod inter caetera ad Galatas scripsit :",
    "chunk_index": 22,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li#PL72.LI.5.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.LI.5.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Si quis evangelizaverit vobis præter id quod accepistis , ana­ thema sii. Sed et illud Evangelium omnis lex et pro­ phetae usque ad Joannem prophetaverunt.",
    "chunk_index": 23,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li#PL72.LI.5.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_31_li",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.LI.5.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Deinceps si qua nova vel inusitata divulgata fuerint, omnino abjicienda et detestanda Sanctitas tua noverit. Ora pro nobis, domine sancte et in Christo charissime frater.",
    "chunk_index": 24,
